cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the 0.8 prerelease software and the historical 0.7 release-candidate white paper using this metadata."
title: "Cockroach Crawler"
type: software
version: 0.8.0-rc.1
date-released: 2026-08-10
authors:
  - family-names: "N B"
    given-names: "Ajnas"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AjnasNB/cockroach-crawler"
url: "https://cockroachcrawler.com"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A governed Node.js web acquisition layer for AI agents with explicit network,
  browser, provider, extraction, resource, and evidence boundaries. Version
  0.8.0-rc.1 adds an opt-in governed Chromium and Firefox automation boundary
  while preserving the frozen 0.7 benchmark and paper evidence. The preferred
  citation remains the historical 0.7 RC paper and does not certify this
  prerelease software.
keywords:
  - web crawler
  - AI agents
  - evidence provenance
  - network policy
  - reproducible evaluation
